{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>ויגל</b> — from the same root as גולות עליות (the surging waters); it is of the doubled-root [binyan] forms, like ימס. So hold all the grammarians of Spain. The sense: do justice, and not sacrifice or song, for I have no desire in them — only in justice."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:11.743303241Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}